Okay, I figured out that .activate() is required when calling the handler, otherwise update will freeze.

Might be easier to inherit from Window_Command instead of Window_Selectable. Then you can do this instead:
Code:
Window_Orbcraft_Conversion.prototype.makeCommandList = function() {
  this.addCommand("Attack > Defense", "atkDef");
  this.addCommand("Defense > Attack", "defAtk");
}
Then you can remove your Window_Orbcraft_Conversion.prototype.drawItem override.

